    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Swing Through</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/80dc2648f15d2609bee6d113217879a9.poster.avif?t=1742336048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/80dc2648f15d2609bee6d113217879a9.webm?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/80dc2648f15d2609bee6d113217879a9.mp4?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Use your grappling hook to traverse levels. Build momentum and time it right to reach places hard to get to</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dodge Danger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/1194a002f4d7f9287e4a0b31894668f4.poster.avif?t=1742336048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/1194a002f4d7f9287e4a0b31894668f4.webm?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/1194a002f4d7f9287e4a0b31894668f4.mp4?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Run and doge enemies as you explore your way out to reach to the next level</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strike Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/09128bb035ceb08dd33a86a0369bb28b.poster.avif?t=1742336048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/09128bb035ceb08dd33a86a0369bb28b.webm?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/09128bb035ceb08dd33a86a0369bb28b.mp4?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aim and shoot your grappling hook at enemies and obstacles to progress through levels</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Try Again Immediately</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/08c0812eedd29564682911f8355fdef5.poster.avif?t=1742336048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/08c0812eedd29564682911f8355fdef5.webm?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/08c0812eedd29564682911f8355fdef5.mp4?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Reloads are instant. Try again from where you left without starting over. No long and boring death screens</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/af3e58558ec68cbe346b0d09f9ef033a.poster.avif?t=1742336048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/af3e58558ec68cbe346b0d09f9ef033a.webm?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/af3e58558ec68cbe346b0d09f9ef033a.mp4?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Meet interesting characters along your way. Friends or foes, meet their personalities and their stories</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Overcome Obstacles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/f9969674207394973b883e26b6740bf0.poster.avif?t=1742336048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/f9969674207394973b883e26b6740bf0.webm?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/f9969674207394973b883e26b6740bf0.mp4?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Put your skills to test in handcrafted challenges on every level</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/9709a676982b5df3bd4bfce297dfa90e.poster.avif?t=1742336048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/9709a676982b5df3bd4bfce297dfa90e.webm?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/9709a676982b5df3bd4bfce297dfa90e.mp4?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Keep an eye open to find secrets. Paths and collectables may be hidden in every corner</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Swing Through</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/80dc2648f15d2609bee6d113217879a9.poster.avif?t=1742336048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/80dc2648f15d2609bee6d113217879a9.webm?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/80dc2648f15d2609bee6d113217879a9.mp4?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Use your grappling hook to traverse levels. Build momentum and time it right to reach places hard to get to</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dodge Danger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/1194a002f4d7f9287e4a0b31894668f4.poster.avif?t=1742336048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/1194a002f4d7f9287e4a0b31894668f4.webm?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/1194a002f4d7f9287e4a0b31894668f4.mp4?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Run and doge enemies as you explore your way out to reach to the next level</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strike Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/09128bb035ceb08dd33a86a0369bb28b.poster.avif?t=1742336048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/09128bb035ceb08dd33a86