/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/f9969674207394973b883e26b6740bf0.poster.avif?t=1742336048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/f9969674207394973b883e26b6740bf0.webm?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/f9969674207394973b883e26b6740bf0.mp4?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Put your skills to test in handcrafted challenges on every level</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/9709a676982b5df3bd4bfce297dfa90e.poster.avif?t=1742336048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/9709a676982b5df3bd4bfce297dfa90e.webm?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1970340/extras/9709a676982b5df3bd4bfce297dfa90e.mp4?t=1742336048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Keep an eye open to find secrets. Paths and collectables may be hidden in every corner</p>",
